WEBVTT

00:27.180 --> 00:28.340
<b>Hmm?</b>

00:40.780 --> 00:43.490
<b>It seems
like he's already made it outside.</b>

00:43.990 --> 00:48.190
<b><i>Man... The fact that he'd been</i>
<i>behaving himself should've tipped me off.</i></b>

00:48.190 --> 00:49.340
<b>GONNA POP OUT FOR A BIT
BAN</b>

00:49.340 --> 00:51.070
<b><i>Damn that old geezer.</i></b>

01:06.670 --> 01:13.420
<b>MISSION: YOZAKURA FAMILY</b>

02:30.430 --> 02:32.340
<b>Hope you had a good day at school.</b>

02:32.770 --> 02:34.110
<b>PLAN 12
PRISON BREAK GRANDPA</b>

02:34.110 --> 02:39.590
<b>You know how the house's facial ID
gets reset if you're away for a year?</b>

02:40.190 --> 02:42.330
<b>I didn't feel like dealing
with all the traps,</b>

02:42.330 --> 02:45.430
<b>so I hopped in just before school let out.</b>

02:49.240 --> 02:52.840
<b>But anyway, you're my new grandchild, huh?</b>

02:52.840 --> 02:55.570
<b>You sure look like a stiff.</b>

02:57.170 --> 02:58.670
<b>Nice to meet you.</b>

02:58.670 --> 03:00.320
<b>I'm your grandpa.</b>

03:03.410 --> 03:04.430
<b>An intruder!</b>

03:04.430 --> 03:07.140
<b>What? Did nothing I said
get through to you?</b>

03:07.140 --> 03:08.290
<b>Hey, hold on!</b>

03:08.290 --> 03:09.390
<b>Time out!</b>

03:12.310 --> 03:16.090
<b>Jeez, for a second there,
I thought I saw Grandma.</b>

03:16.090 --> 03:19.400
<b>Sorry, Mutsumi. I kind of freaked out.</b>

03:19.400 --> 03:22.050
<b>Anyone would have.
That was proper self-defense.</b>

03:22.480 --> 03:24.510
<b>Let's start over.
I'll introduce you.</b>

03:24.510 --> 03:26.160
<b>This is Grandpa Ban.</b>

03:26.160 --> 03:27.530
<b>Nice to meet you!</b>

03:28.910 --> 03:31.330
<b>Please use this, if you'd like.</b>

03:32.190 --> 03:33.710
<b>Why, thank you, young lady!</b>

03:33.710 --> 03:38.570
<b>Well, who knew that you'd hired
such a lovely maid while I was away?</b>

03:38.960 --> 03:42.450
<b>Would you like to go shopping with me now?</b>

03:43.630 --> 03:44.910
<b><i>Who is this guy?</i></b>

03:45.470 --> 03:46.810
<b>Huh?</b>

03:46.810 --> 03:49.390
<b>Right, enough with the jokes.</b>

03:49.790 --> 03:53.440
<b>Those reflexes of yours weren't bad!
What a good husband you are!</b>

03:53.440 --> 03:54.940
<b>Grandpa's mind is at ease now!</b>

03:54.940 --> 03:57.750
<b>It was worth coming
all this way to see you!</b>

03:58.020 --> 04:00.570
<b>Here. A wedding gift-slash-pocket money
from me.</b>

04:01.570 --> 04:04.780
<b>You didn't really come here
just to congratulate us, did you?</b>

04:04.780 --> 04:08.080
<b>For my beloved newlywed grandchildren?
Of course I did!</b>

04:08.080 --> 04:11.140
<b>I wish I'd come sooner, actually.</b>

04:11.380 --> 04:14.020
<b>Well, and there's one other reason.</b>

04:14.770 --> 04:17.960
<b>Taiyo! Time for a fun outing
with your new grandpa!</b>

04:17.960 --> 04:21.400
<b>Come on, let's go!
What? All of a sudden?</b>

04:22.540 --> 04:23.720
<b>Huh?</b>

04:24.110 --> 04:26.300
<b>What are you doing here, Gramps?</b>

04:26.300 --> 04:27.580
<b>Big Bro!</b>

04:27.810 --> 04:32.190
<b>Hey, Kyoichiro. I thought
you were away on an overseas mission.</b>

04:32.190 --> 04:34.870
<b>I got an emergency request
from the police.</b>

04:34.870 --> 04:38.630
<b>Namely, "Bring back the escaped convict,
Ban Yozakura."</b>

04:38.630 --> 04:39.730
<b>Escaped convict?</b>

04:39.730 --> 04:43.090
<b>Oh, come on, don't put it that way.
It's misleading.</b>

04:44.110 --> 04:46.370
<b><i>I'm just permanently stationed</i>
<i>inside that prison</i></b>

04:46.370 --> 04:49.310
<b><i>as part of my mission</i>
<i>to gather info from the underworld.</i></b>

04:49.850 --> 04:54.670
<b>Okay? I'll be going back soon, so let me
have some fun outside for a moment!</b>

04:54.670 --> 04:56.060
<b>Out of the question.</b>

04:56.490 --> 04:59.960
<b>Gramps, you're a walking leak who'll spill
any secret just to impress the ladies.</b>

04:59.960 --> 05:02.760
<b>SCAMS, CORRUPTION, ASSASSINATIONS,
SPIES, BACKDOOR DEALS, SCANDALS</b>

05:02.760 --> 05:06.050
<b>Except for emergencies,
you're prohibited from going out.</b>

05:06.050 --> 05:07.530
<b><i>He's unfit to be a pro!</i></b>

05:07.530 --> 05:10.600
<b>Hate to break it to you,
but your vacation's over.</b>

05:10.600 --> 05:14.000
<b>I don't want to hurt you. Don't resist.</b>

05:15.470 --> 05:19.340
<b>Well, someone's gotten cocky
in the short time since I last saw him.</b>

05:19.340 --> 05:23.110
<b>Seems like he's forgotten
who changed his diapers.</b>

05:24.050 --> 05:25.170
<b>Hmm?</b>

05:25.680 --> 05:28.300
<b>Stop me if you can, greenhorn.</b>

05:28.300 --> 05:30.220
<b><i>What? He slipped through?</i></b>

05:37.400 --> 05:41.110
<b>Oh, no. He took Taiyo with him.</b>

05:43.830 --> 05:45.070
<b><i>How's it looking?</i></b>

05:45.070 --> 05:47.140
<b>Sorry! He got away from me.
</b>

05:47.140 --> 05:49.430
<b><i>Is that right?</i>
<i>Well, it is what it is.</i></b>

05:49.430 --> 05:51.580
<b>That said,
I've got Taiyo tracking him.</b>

05:51.580 --> 05:53.790
<b>I'll send you the coordinates later.</b>

05:53.790 --> 05:55.350
<b>A photo?</b>

06:03.210 --> 06:04.770
<b>Listen up, Taiyo.</b>

06:05.110 --> 06:08.950
<b>With his Joint Dislocation Skills
and Flexible Skeleton,</b>

06:08.950 --> 06:12.810
<b>Grandpa Ban is a legendary mole who
can infiltrate or escape any facility.</b>

06:13.070 --> 06:17.080
<b>He's gathered a massive amount of data
over several decades.</b>

06:17.080 --> 06:20.770
<b>There are as many people gunning for it
as there are stars in the sky.</b>

06:20.770 --> 06:23.380
<b><i>It won't kill him</i>
<i>if you rough him up a bit.</i></b>

06:23.380 --> 06:26.750
<b><i>Catch him before things get out of hand,</i>
<i>for the old guy's sake as well.</i></b>

06:27.090 --> 06:28.260
<b>Roger that.</b>

06:28.260 --> 06:29.840
<b><i>So what's Gramps up to now?</i></b>

06:29.840 --> 06:32.600
<b>We're at what he says
is a members-only bar.</b>

06:32.600 --> 06:33.740
<b>All right!</b>

06:33.740 --> 06:38.440
<b>You bet I'm going to order
the hottest diamond ring on the market!</b>

06:38.440 --> 06:40.960
<b>Aah! Ban, that's so generous of you!</b>

06:40.960 --> 06:43.070
<b><i>He's hitting on women</i>
<i>left and right!</i></b>

06:43.070 --> 06:44.820
<b><i>Aww. You're so cute, little boy!</i></b>

06:44.820 --> 06:47.070
<b><i>-</i> <i>H-Hey, cut that out!</i>
<i>-</i> <i>Is that a cosplay?</i></b>

06:47.070 --> 06:48.380
<b><i>I have a wife!</i></b>

06:48.380 --> 06:53.280
<b>While I'm being generous,
want to hear some hilarious state secrets?</b>

06:53.280 --> 06:55.160
<b>Yes! Tell us, tell us!</b>

06:55.160 --> 06:58.100
<b><i>I'm on the front lines</i>
<i>of an info leak!</i></b>

06:58.580 --> 07:01.960
<b>Using the country's ***** slush funds,
they ***** and *****...</b>

07:01.960 --> 07:03.940
<b>You're out!</b>

07:06.320 --> 07:08.280
<b>Whoa!
</b>

07:11.820 --> 07:15.510
<b>You're way too young to hold me back.</b>

07:15.510 --> 07:16.740
<b>Huh?</b>

07:17.970 --> 07:20.500
<b>Extreme Glue, Nanao Rice Cake.</b>

07:20.740 --> 07:23.080
<b>I'm sorry, but this is it!</b>

07:25.170 --> 07:26.730
<b>So naive.</b>

07:29.310 --> 07:32.370
<b>The only thing that can stop me
is a beautiful woman.</b>

07:32.370 --> 07:35.370
<b>Oh, wow! Ban, you're so cool!</b>

07:35.370 --> 07:37.060
<b><i>Damn that geezer.</i></b>

07:38.910 --> 07:42.650
<b>Come on, youngster.
I'll give you some training!</b>

07:42.650 --> 07:44.110
<b>You...</b>

07:44.110 --> 07:46.020
<b>Damn it!</b>

07:50.320 --> 07:53.780
<b>Give it another five years.
Then you'll be able to at least graze me.</b>

07:54.210 --> 07:57.050
<b><i>Is this guy actually old?</i></b>

07:58.970 --> 08:03.080
<b>So, why did you go through all the trouble
of breaking out of prison?</b>

08:03.600 --> 08:07.480
<b>If you wanted to see us, couldn't
you just wait till your mission was over?</b>

08:09.980 --> 08:11.800
<b>It had to be today.</b>

08:11.800 --> 08:12.900
<b>What?</b>

08:14.480 --> 08:18.220
<b>A youngster like you
wouldn't get it just yet.</b>

08:20.240 --> 08:22.830
<b>It's been a long time, Mr. Ban.</b>

08:22.830 --> 08:25.860
<b>Here is the three-year-old
Kitamare vintage sake.</b>

08:25.860 --> 08:28.710
<b>Ah! That was Grandma's favorite sake.</b>

08:28.710 --> 08:30.380
<b>Sure brings back memories!</b>

08:30.380 --> 08:31.770
<b>Give me a few bottles.</b>

08:31.770 --> 08:35.640
<b>All right, Taiyo. Pick yourself up
by guzzling this down! Go!</b>

08:35.640 --> 08:37.870
<b>You do know I'm underage, right?</b>

08:39.550 --> 08:43.310
<b>Being a spy is all about
drinking, smoking, and women.</b>

08:43.720 --> 08:46.810
<b>You beta males nowadays are so boring.</b>

08:47.730 --> 08:50.570
<b>At this rate, you'll never
give me a great-grandchild.</b>

08:51.150 --> 08:53.030
<b>G-Great-grandchild?</b>

08:53.030 --> 08:55.380
<b>You naive modern kid, you!</b>

08:55.380 --> 08:57.530
<b>Well then, for future reference,</b>

08:57.530 --> 09:02.870
<b>how about I go into graphic detail
about me and Grandma making out?</b>

09:02.870 --> 09:06.060
<b>I really don't need to hear that.
Save it, please.</b>

09:06.060 --> 09:12.010
<b>Grandma was a gorgeous woman with
lustrous, dark hair and a cheerful smile.</b>

09:12.010 --> 09:13.440
<b><i>I'm not listening.</i></b>

09:15.250 --> 09:18.830
<b>Before I met her,
I had no one else in the world...</b>

09:19.260 --> 09:21.100
<b><i>I never opened up to anyone,</i></b>

09:21.100 --> 09:24.180
<b><i>and I didn't care what happened,</i>
<i>not even to myself.</i></b>

09:25.010 --> 09:26.310
<b><i>Just like me?</i></b>

09:27.470 --> 09:32.230
<b><i>It was Keiko who shone a light</i>
<i>on the life I was leading so recklessly.</i></b>

09:40.720 --> 09:46.000
<b>Take care of yourself
like you take care of me, Ban.</b>

09:49.660 --> 09:51.750
<b>She was a fine woman.</b>

09:57.380 --> 10:01.050
<b>She was way too good for the likes of me.</b>

10:02.970 --> 10:05.930
<b>I'm getting the sense that you're like me.</b>

10:06.510 --> 10:08.730
<b>That's why I wanted
to talk about this with you,</b>

10:08.730 --> 10:11.170
<b>as a guy who also
married into the Yozakura clan.</b>

10:11.170 --> 10:14.400
<b>Love may be infinite, but life is finite.</b>

10:15.650 --> 10:19.390
<b>Cherish the present
so you'll never have any regrets.</b>

10:21.190 --> 10:25.350
<b>For you two to be happy,
that's all I ever want.</b>

10:27.700 --> 10:29.650
<b>You don't have to worry.</b>

10:31.870 --> 10:35.780
<b>Mutsumi has made me happier
than I ever could've hoped.</b>

10:36.710 --> 10:38.970
<b>I don't have a single regret.</b>

10:40.090 --> 10:43.930
<b>I'm going to do all that I can so that
Mutsumi feels the same about me.</b>

10:44.380 --> 10:46.640
<b>That's really the only thing I can do.</b>

11:02.760 --> 11:05.540
<b>You know what,
I like you, Taiyo!</b>

11:05.540 --> 11:09.620
<b>Okay, let me take you
to an even better bar than this one!</b>

11:09.620 --> 11:10.710
<b>Welcome.</b>

11:10.710 --> 11:12.560
<b>I don't think...
 Don't be shy!</b>

11:12.560 --> 11:14.590
<b>I told you it's all right!
Ow, ow, ow!</b>

11:14.590 --> 11:15.940
<b>Huh?</b>

11:16.370 --> 11:18.840
<b>I knew I'd find you here.</b>

11:20.420 --> 11:24.160
<b>These handcuffs will explode if you try
to take them off by force or break them.</b>

11:24.720 --> 11:28.790
<b>You'd better behave yourself if you
don't want to blow off your wife's hand.</b>

11:28.790 --> 11:30.750
<b>K-Keiko!</b>

11:30.750 --> 11:34.230
<b>Sorry we got here so late, Taiyo.</b>

11:34.230 --> 11:35.460
<b>Mutsumi?</b>

11:35.460 --> 11:38.530
<b>Let me introduce you two.
This is my grandma.</b>

11:38.530 --> 11:40.320
<b>Sorry for my idiot husband, Taiyo.</b>

11:40.320 --> 11:41.880
<b>KEIKO YOZAKURA
EIGHTH FAMILY HEAD</b>

11:42.150 --> 11:43.640
<b>G-Grandma--</b>

11:43.640 --> 11:45.410
<b>Keiko!</b>

11:45.410 --> 11:47.250
<b>I never thought I'd get to see you!</b>

11:47.250 --> 11:49.040
<b><i>She's alive?</i></b>

11:49.040 --> 11:52.600
<b>Unbelievable. Thank goodness
Mutsumi called me.</b>

11:52.600 --> 11:54.920
<b>Look! It's your favorite sake, Kitamare!</b>

11:54.920 --> 11:59.170
<b>And I also consulted the girls
to buy you this popular ring!</b>

11:59.170 --> 12:01.340
<b>So let's go on a date today!</b>

12:01.340 --> 12:04.890
<b>Don't be ridiculous.
You and I both have work to do.</b>

12:04.890 --> 12:06.830
<b>Now get yourself back to prison.</b>

12:07.510 --> 12:09.290
<b>What? No way!</b>

12:09.290 --> 12:12.750
<b>Come on, it's our anniversary!
I want to make out with you, Keiko!</b>

12:15.730 --> 12:19.070
<b>It's their anniversary, huh?
That explains why he broke out today.</b>

12:19.070 --> 12:22.860
<b>Right. I'd forgotten about it, too,
until I saw the photo.</b>

12:23.360 --> 12:25.990
<b>Well, I guess I know how he feels.</b>

12:32.240 --> 12:36.810
<b>Mutsumi has made me happier
than I ever could've hoped.</b>

12:37.960 --> 12:40.150
<b>I don't have a single regret.</b>

12:47.370 --> 12:48.470
<b>Oh.</b>

12:51.010 --> 12:52.180
<b>Right.</b>

13:00.810 --> 13:02.940
<b>She got herself a good husband, huh?</b>

13:02.940 --> 13:05.650
<b>Yes. Just like I did.</b>

13:13.240 --> 13:15.710
<b>Apparently Grandpa managed
to cry his way</b>

13:15.710 --> 13:17.730
<b>into getting a date just for that one day.</b>

13:17.730 --> 13:21.590
<b>The one thing to learn from him is
how to be so lovey-dovey even in old age.</b>

13:29.950 --> 13:31.910
<b>KING OF CHEATING</b>

13:32.590 --> 13:35.540
<b>I'm home, my darling grandkids!</b>

13:35.540 --> 13:38.110
<b>I ended up breaking out of prison again!</b>

13:38.110 --> 13:40.940
<b>Here! I brought you
some Prison Break treats.</b>

13:40.940 --> 13:42.900
<b>Oh, Ayaka?</b>

13:42.900 --> 13:44.030
<b>Where is everybody?</b>

13:44.030 --> 13:46.680
<b>They've all gone out today.</b>

13:47.070 --> 13:50.410
<b>It's the monthly family shopping trip.</b>

13:50.410 --> 13:51.890
<b>What?</b>

13:51.890 --> 13:55.080
<b><i>I wanted to go, too!</i></b>

13:55.600 --> 13:57.690
<b>So, what should we do after this?</b>

13:57.690 --> 14:01.170
<b>I'm going over to Kane's,
so let's split up.</b>

14:01.170 --> 14:02.650
<b>Yeah, me too.</b>

14:02.650 --> 14:04.930
<b>I'm going to the drugstore.</b>

14:04.930 --> 14:06.800
<b>Want to come with me, Big Bro Kengo?</b>

14:06.800 --> 14:08.110
<b>Yeah, I'm in!</b>

14:08.110 --> 14:10.850
<b>Okay, why don't we split up for now?</b>

14:10.850 --> 14:12.890
<b>All right, let's head out now.</b>

14:14.540 --> 14:18.210
<b>We're counting on you
to take care of the bill, "eldest son."</b>

14:18.210 --> 14:20.480
<b>As if I'd fall for that.</b>

14:20.480 --> 14:22.730
<b>The only thing I'm paying for is Mutsumi--</b>

14:24.860 --> 14:26.170
<b>Won't you?</b>

14:27.400 --> 14:28.570
<b>Check, please!</b>

14:28.570 --> 14:30.570
<b>Thank you very much!</b>

14:32.740 --> 14:34.870
<b>All right, let's meet up in two hours.</b>

14:34.870 --> 14:36.100
<b>Okay!</b>

14:38.700 --> 14:42.770
<b><i>You know, it's been a while</i>
<i>since I was last at this mall.</i></b>

14:43.620 --> 14:46.670
<b><i>We used to come here all the time</i>
<i>way back when...</i></b>

14:48.710 --> 14:49.860
<b>Taiyo?</b>

14:49.860 --> 14:51.100
<b>Is something the matter?</b>

14:51.100 --> 14:53.300
<b>No, it's nothing.</b>

14:55.140 --> 14:57.770
<b>By the way, what are we getting today?</b>

14:57.770 --> 15:02.540
<b>Let's see.
Tissues, toilet paper, milk, eggs...</b>

15:02.540 --> 15:04.150
<b>bullets, hand grenades--</b>

15:04.150 --> 15:05.760
<b>Hold up. Hold up. Hold up.</b>

15:05.760 --> 15:09.070
<b>Man, I've been dying to see this movie.</b>

15:09.070 --> 15:10.950
<b>Sui, don't piss yourself in fear, okay?</b>

15:10.950 --> 15:12.410
<b>You hear that, Oga?</b>

15:12.410 --> 15:13.720
<b>What? Why me?</b>

15:14.570 --> 15:16.240
<b>Oh, there it is!</b>

15:16.910 --> 15:19.140
<b>Let's see, for 100 yen...</b>

15:19.580 --> 15:21.960
<b><i>So Mutsumi's</i>
<i>into this kind of thing?</i></b>

15:21.960 --> 15:23.840
<b>Left thrice.
Right once. Left twice.</b>

15:23.840 --> 15:25.610
<b><i>She's a bit childlike</i>
<i>in some ways.</i></b>

15:28.210 --> 15:29.530
<b>All right! Here it is!</b>

15:30.990 --> 15:32.260
<b>Whoa, heavy!</b>

15:32.260 --> 15:34.300
<b><i>Hand grenades?</i></b>

15:37.200 --> 15:38.600
<b>It sure is crowded, huh?</b>

15:38.600 --> 15:39.930
<b>Y-Yeah.</b>

15:41.670 --> 15:44.130
<b>Welcome! May I take your order?</b>

15:44.130 --> 15:47.320
<b>100 kilograms
of iron tapioca milk tea, please!</b>

15:47.320 --> 15:49.340
<b>And what's iron tapioca, Mutsumi?</b>

15:49.340 --> 15:51.160
<b>Thank you very much!</b>

15:51.160 --> 15:53.750
<b>You can pay with cash, by credit card...</b>

15:53.750 --> 15:56.500
<b>or in blood or eyeballs.</b>

15:56.500 --> 15:57.910
<b><i>She understood the order!</i></b>

15:57.910 --> 16:00.180
<b><i>But those payment methods are scary!</i></b>

16:02.740 --> 16:06.400
<b>Handguns are "milk tea,"
and rifles are "coffee."</b>

16:06.670 --> 16:11.010
<b>Mutsumi, I'm starting to get an inkling,
but is this place...</b>

16:11.010 --> 16:13.390
<b>Yes. At this mall, they sell supplies</b>

16:13.390 --> 16:18.060
<b>for spies, con artists, assassins,
and members of the underworld.</b>

16:18.550 --> 16:20.600
<b>Okay, let's move on to our next stop.</b>

16:21.680 --> 16:24.480
<b>For that memory ball
from the '00s,</b>

16:24.480 --> 16:28.090
<b>this alloy catalyst for analysis
should do the trick.</b>

16:28.090 --> 16:29.780
<b>Thanks, Kane.</b>

16:29.780 --> 16:31.320
<b>Come on, let's go, Shinzo.</b>

16:31.320 --> 16:32.800
<b>H-Hold up!</b>

16:32.800 --> 16:33.820
<b>KANEKICHI
WEAPONS SHOP</b>

16:33.820 --> 16:35.780
<b>That one comes
in this year's new color.</b>

16:35.780 --> 16:40.040
<b>What is this, apparel?
Can't make up my mind.</b>

16:40.820 --> 16:42.600
<b>The choice is clear.</b>

16:42.990 --> 16:48.480
<b>Whenever you waver, you pick the product
in your right hand 85% of the time.</b>

16:48.480 --> 16:50.130
<b>But 97% of the time,</b>

16:50.130 --> 16:53.320
<b>you regret that choice
within two days of getting home.</b>

16:53.320 --> 16:57.470
<b>So, there's a 99% chance
that the left one will be the right pick.</b>

16:57.470 --> 17:00.430
<b>Thanks for your business!
Shion, you're amazing!</b>

17:00.430 --> 17:02.790
<b>Know yourself, my dimwit big bro.</b>

17:02.790 --> 17:05.250
<b>CHIYOMOMIN</b>

17:09.100 --> 17:12.170
<b>You're as stiff as ever, Futaba.</b>

17:12.170 --> 17:15.280
<b>How many did you take out this month?</b>

17:15.280 --> 17:17.700
<b>About 300?</b>

17:17.700 --> 17:19.080
<b>Don't give me that.</b>

17:19.080 --> 17:21.390
<b>You're stiff enough to have hurled 500!</b>

17:21.390 --> 17:22.410
<b>CHIYO
EX-BODYGUARD, 97</b>

17:22.410 --> 17:26.600
<b>Whatever you do, your body is your asset.
Young or not, don't ever overdo it.</b>

17:27.080 --> 17:29.300
<b>Ah, feels so good...</b>

17:29.300 --> 17:32.320
<b><i>Is she bending a steel pipe</i>
<i>or something next door?</i></b>

17:32.320 --> 17:34.280
<b>DRUGSTORE
TRIP</b>

17:36.410 --> 17:37.720
<b>TRIP
A DRUGSTORE THAT HAS IT ALL</b>

17:37.720 --> 17:39.970
<b>Isn't this cyanide too concentrated?</b>

17:39.970 --> 17:43.220
<b>Well, these days,
a lot of people have high tolerance.</b>

17:43.220 --> 17:47.110
<b>This is a facial pack that soothes
skin and muscles made rough by disguises.</b>

17:47.110 --> 17:49.420
<b>I can feel it working!</b>

17:58.320 --> 18:00.410
<b>Welcome, Mr. Yozakura.</b>

18:00.410 --> 18:02.870
<b>I've obtained the product you wanted.</b>

18:07.560 --> 18:11.770
<b>MI-CHAN'S BOOKSHELF
HORRIFYING BOOKS FROM ALL OVER THE WORLD</b>

18:12.380 --> 18:14.260
<b>Including
the removal of blood</b>

18:14.260 --> 18:17.510
<b>and bulletproofing of this shirt,
that will be 4,980 yen.</b>

18:17.510 --> 18:19.700
<b>Th-Thank you very much.</b>

18:19.700 --> 18:22.160
<b>HAKUINSHA
CATCHPHRASE IS "WILL CLEAN ANYTHING"</b>

18:22.160 --> 18:23.230
<b>PICKED IT UP.
HEADING BACK</b>

18:23.230 --> 18:24.620
<b>MUTSUMI
THANKS!</b>

18:24.620 --> 18:27.360
<b>Oh.</b>

18:27.360 --> 18:28.580
<b>Uh?</b>

18:30.730 --> 18:32.300
<b>Daddy.</b>

18:33.730 --> 18:34.900
<b>Mutsumi?</b>

18:38.570 --> 18:39.660
<b>Your love child?</b>

18:39.660 --> 18:41.220
<b>Are you kidding me?</b>

18:41.460 --> 18:44.750
<b>Seems like this girl
got separated from her dad.</b>

18:44.750 --> 18:46.250
<b>Oh, I see.</b>

18:47.160 --> 18:48.580
<b>What's your name?</b>

18:48.580 --> 18:50.630
<b>S-Suzu.</b>

18:50.630 --> 18:55.940
<b>So, Suzu, do you remember where it was
that you got separated from your father?</b>

18:56.420 --> 19:00.360
<b>The scary people took my daddy away.</b>

19:00.360 --> 19:03.350
<b>What?
Where did they take your father?</b>

19:04.970 --> 19:07.640
<b>Th-They said,
"Let's talk downstairs."</b>

19:12.480 --> 19:15.840
<b>This mall has
an unmarked basement floor,</b>

19:15.840 --> 19:17.820
<b>where you'll find a black market</b>

19:17.820 --> 19:20.760
<b>that sells products
that are too edgy for upstairs.</b>

19:22.740 --> 19:24.260
<b>Gaon basement floor one...</b>

19:24.260 --> 19:25.620
<b>Gaon Castle.</b>

19:25.620 --> 19:27.230
<b><i>So seedy!</i></b>

19:27.910 --> 19:29.580
<b>Make sure you stay alert, okay?</b>

19:29.580 --> 19:32.860
<b>If you let your guard down,
you'll end up as a product.</b>

19:32.860 --> 19:34.360
<b><i>You mean dismembered?</i></b>

19:34.360 --> 19:36.340
<b>Miss, I'm scared.</b>

19:36.340 --> 19:37.490
<b>Don't worry.</b>

19:37.490 --> 19:41.260
<b>These people are well aware
of the risks of targeting me.</b>

19:41.960 --> 19:43.220
<b>Please, spare me!</b>

19:43.220 --> 19:44.410
<b>Daddy!
 This way!</b>

19:44.880 --> 19:46.310
<b>Please don't do this.</b>

19:46.310 --> 19:48.600
<b>I quit being a mule!</b>

19:48.600 --> 19:52.380
<b>Losing your nerve
just because you have a kid now...</b>

19:52.380 --> 19:56.090
<b>You can pay the penalty
with your lungs and eyes.</b>

19:57.270 --> 19:58.420
<b>N-No.</b>

19:58.660 --> 20:00.010
<b>Back off!</b>

20:03.990 --> 20:05.330
<b>Daddy!</b>

20:05.330 --> 20:06.470
<b>Suzu!</b>

20:07.700 --> 20:10.560
<b>Come on, let's get out of here now.
Right.</b>

20:11.580 --> 20:13.150
<b>Taiyo Asano!</b>

20:13.150 --> 20:17.110
<b>The Yozakura head is one thing,
but you're a great prize yourself!</b>

20:17.110 --> 20:20.570
<b>How about a blood-loss special
for $500,000?</b>

20:20.570 --> 20:22.030
<b><i>Who, me?</i></b>

20:22.030 --> 20:24.390
<b>First come, first served!</b>

20:27.910 --> 20:30.830
<b>Uh--
You're done shopping, right?</b>

20:31.720 --> 20:33.580
<b>We're heading home, you two.</b>

20:33.580 --> 20:36.090
<b>K-Kyoichiro Yozakura.</b>

20:36.090 --> 20:37.190
<b>Big Bro!</b>

20:37.190 --> 20:38.840
<b>Big Bro Kyoichiro--</b>

20:38.840 --> 20:39.940
<b>Huh?</b>

20:40.760 --> 20:42.760
<b>COMPLETE COLLECTION OF TORTURE</b>

20:42.760 --> 20:44.830
<b><i>It's because</i>
<i>he wants to try that on me...</i></b>

20:44.830 --> 20:47.220
<b><i>...that he saved you, huh?</i>
<i>-</i></b>

20:47.220 --> 20:49.870
<b>Damn it, we can't possibly
beat the eldest son.</b>

20:49.870 --> 20:51.710
<b>Idiot! Stand your ground.</b>

20:51.710 --> 20:55.250
<b>They may be Yozakuras,
but the numbers are on our side.</b>

20:57.400 --> 20:58.190
<b>Whoa!</b>

21:09.120 --> 21:11.470
<b>What, they're all here?</b>

21:13.810 --> 21:16.230
<b>Y-You'll pay for this, you monsters!</b>

21:16.230 --> 21:18.230
<b>I swear I'll get my reven--</b>

21:18.730 --> 21:20.840
<b>Huh?</b>

21:24.260 --> 21:27.200
<b>Doesn't today's 4D technology
blow your mind?</b>

21:27.200 --> 21:29.160
<b>Even the screams are realistic!</b>

21:29.160 --> 21:31.220
<b>The building is collapsing for real.</b>

21:33.030 --> 21:34.850
<b>Them again, huh?</b>

21:34.850 --> 21:36.210
<b>BREAKING NEWS - MYSTERIOUS SINKING</b>

21:36.210 --> 21:37.300
<b><i>This just in.</i></b>

21:37.300 --> 21:40.070
<b><i>It appears the first floor of Gaon Mall</i>
<i>has sunk into the ground.</i></b>

21:46.740 --> 21:50.060
<b>Isn't it great
that Suzu was reunited with her dad?</b>

21:50.060 --> 21:53.960
<b>Yeah. But... wasn't the damage
a bit excessive?</b>

21:53.960 --> 21:59.440
<b>Seriously? You couldn't even handle
that on your own, you ***** little--</b>

22:00.440 --> 22:02.610
<b>Hey! We forgot to buy gifts
for Ayaka and the others.</b>

22:02.610 --> 22:03.920
<b>We bought them.</b>

22:04.160 --> 22:06.370
<b>Let's come again, okay, Taiyo?</b>

22:06.370 --> 22:07.530
<b>Sure.</b>

23:43.620 --> 23:46.960
<b>NEXT TIME
TANPOPO</b>
